OBSERVATION NOISE
Independent observation noise SD:

0.30.

Task cue count:

3 independent current observations.

Thus current cue noise variance per represented direction is approximately:

0.09 / 3
=
0.03.

PERMANENT STRUCTURAL COST
Each active slow basis direction pays:

0.015

synthetic utility units per observation.

This is an explicit resource penalty.

It is not a proposed biological constant.

STRUCTURAL VALUE
For one candidate basis direction,
the approximate benefit of keeping the direction is:

persistent signal variance

minus

remaining cue-noise variance

minus

permanent structural cost.

Therefore:
a dimension should not remain active merely because some variance exists.

It must create enough reusable denoising value to justify its permanent cost.

TWO-VIEW SIGNAL ESTIMATION
Each event provides two independent noisy local views:

A
and
B.

The controller maintains an EMA of cross-view covariance.

Because the observation noise in A and B is independent,
their cross-covariance estimates persistent shared signal while rejecting most independent observation noise.

Noise variance is separately estimated from:

(A - B)^2 / 2.

No true latent rank is supplied.

No semantic phase label is supplied.

RAW-COVARIANCE NEGATIVE CONTROL
A comparator estimates structure from one noisy view alone.

Because observation noise contributes positive covariance,
the raw controller interprets noise as reusable structure.

STRUCTURAL POLICIES

FIXED-1
always retain rank 1.

FIXED-2
always rank 2.

FIXED-3
always rank 3.

RAW-RANK
activate any of the first three raw covariance dimensions whose observed variance exceeds structural cost.

It does NOT subtract estimated observation noise.

CROSS-RANK
use cross-view shared-signal eigenvalues.

Activate every dimension whose estimated net structural value is positive.

No rank-change hysteresis.

HYSTERETIC STRUCTURAL CONTROLLER
same cross-view value estimate,

but:

grow one dimension only after:
2 consecutive 100-event blocks
with positive margin.

prune one dimension only after:
3 consecutive 100-event blocks
with negative margin.

Exploratory margin:
0.004.

ORACLE
uses the true latent structure and economically correct rank.

This is an unavailable upper bound.

PRIMARY CONFIRMATION
12 matched seeds.

Total observations per seed:

25000.

